":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Project management will need to be able to give people access","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:39Z","entityUuid":"9b723841-1bd4-487c-b45c-f0a369330b3a","parentUuid":"b1faddd1-2f9f-48a8-b9a7-d8f6f8c02470","uuid":"8f4e3fec-26bc-4bf6-bd21-f50909276224"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"The work space should be connected to a single-sign-on system","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:40Z","entityUuid":"4bb35a94-e387-4460-bcf3-d638f248e52c","parentUuid":"b1faddd1-2f9f-48a8-b9a7-d8f6f8c02470","uuid":"e38558e2-c539-4fb7-a259-3bb5087ca40e"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"Will the work space storage need to be remote mounted?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:41Z","entityUuid":"f99580d5-b3ea-498c-86ac-f7326bd999c2","parentUuid":"54e9c073-52ee-4f8d-a1aa-1d279ec0f61d","uuid":"514a6d86-2447-4295-9128-06fce4ee3094"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:42Z","entityUuid":"68be7c83-54ed-46d4-a77f-b99488665f1c","parentUuid":"f99580d5-b3ea-498c-86ac-f7326bd999c2","uuid":"6634cfef-262f-41f4-93a9-be4505a9882d"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No, data will be copied if it needs to be processed elsewhere","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:43Z","entityUuid":"f848f3ec-08c8-4197-bd4f-6d438bac4d70","parentUuid":"f99580d5-b3ea-498c-86ac-f7326bd999c2","uuid":"f0ca571e-1560-40b3-81df-a19e2bdcd578"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No, all data processing will be done in the same environment (virtual research environment)","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:44Z","entityUuid":"bdf255fd-6dd6-4f1e-a9e2-d6aec9d01678","parentUuid":"f99580d5-b3ea-498c-86ac-f7326bd999c2","uuid":"393a596d-70c2-4fe2-a1f4-d80f40b74cbd"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes, for occasional exploration","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:45Z","entityUuid":"6baa53fe-c657-4da3-bb65-9b71f7141c6d","parentUuid":"f99580d5-b3ea-498c-86ac-f7326bd999c2","uuid":"13c23644-64d4-458b-b5e3-dfbcb6a52979"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes, for actual computations, requiring high performance","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:46Z","entityUuid":"5ab6d069-f46c-4514-8114-79c9fe01a93f","parentUuid":"f99580d5-b3ea-498c-86ac-f7326bd999c2","uuid":"f8120138-8762-4921-80fc-3394858535d0"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"Will data be copied out and in to the workspace storage by remote users?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:47Z","entityUuid":"f14750e9-3a39-4aae-b2c8-845583934c1d","parentUuid":"54e9c073-52ee-4f8d-a1aa-1d279ec0f61d","uuid":"b3aeae6a-2e46-4f21-9d02-684c7ee6ed25"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"description":"Workflow that is split over multiple work locations","eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","referenceType":"CrossReference","targetUuid":"410f3709-c283-4974-83c8-6c5d24899a68"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:48Z","entityUuid":"5b22075d-c62f-4e7f-8a57-79c930d81094","parentUuid":"f14750e9-3a39-4aae-b2c8-845583934c1d","uuid":"d90dfbb4-fceb-4ebc-89ad-1c23af87917c"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No, this should not be allowed","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:49Z","entityUuid":"2c2cd046-89e0-4f55-bafa-92eb5f77c3a8","parentUuid":"f14750e9-3a39-4aae-b2c8-845583934c1d","uuid":"9c238ad9-bcdd-40af-ad14-f673f62c7d09"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No, all data processing will be done in the same environment (virtual research environment)","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:50Z","entityUuid":"8fee76df-9eef-4912-9b11-31ebad574ced","parentUuid":"f14750e9-3a39-4aae-b2c8-845583934c1d","uuid":"60ba0961-f4c4-4492-8a3e-4e032a4b22dc"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes, occasionally","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:51Z","entityUuid":"8fa969a0-7477-41be-aefc-a54a8045c954","parentUuid":"f14750e9-3a39-4aae-b2c8-845583934c1d","uuid":"d25d570e-3193-41d9-84ea-11933064c7b8"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes, for actual computations, requiring high performance","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:52Z","entityUuid":"06a34c86-3c48-4fa4-8888-0ae6b613068f","parentUuid":"f14750e9-3a39-4aae-b2c8-845583934c1d","uuid":"db417131-377b-41f5-b117-5b0417094150"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"Are data integrity and reliability requirements also met by the other storage spaces used in the project?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:53Z","entityUuid":"6b3f13db-407a-44e0-9d23-e6dd6a20ad59","parentUuid":"06a34c86-3c48-4fa4-8888-0ae6b613068f","uuid":"9d89fb77-3298-40d3-8a39-95923c613981"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"This is not needed","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:54Z","entityUuid":"c7a0181c-1921-4b21-9481-f4274d48876c","parentUuid":"6b3f13db-407a-44e0-9d23-e6dd6a20ad59","uuid":"359c8028-462d-420b-b492-e575f3df0906"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:55Z","entityUuid":"a1c5e3e9-d286-4e5b-8223-c7e6bbc6e333","parentUuid":"6b3f13db-407a-44e0-9d23-e6dd6a20ad59","uuid":"950355b4-f5f3-4fec-9f9d-c978a75311b0"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"There are a number of questions that can help you to decide whether your work space will be reliable enough for your project.","title":"How available/reliable should must the work space be?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:56Z","entityUuid":"b171ec17-d7b5-4726-ae22-0d892b106cf8","parentUuid":"e7324e1a-bfcb-4f2b-855a-35701dfb1ad5","uuid":"0bec84c3-86cb-44dd-a3ca-826839e1e22e"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Explore","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:57Z","entityUuid":"0d64d3c6-4312-47a9-92ad-0bc9440d6e45","parentUuid":"b171ec17-d7b5-4726-ae22-0d892b106cf8","uuid":"09a544ff-6295-4f4c-a309-767a61c3de86"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"What is the acceptable risk for a total loss?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:58Z","entityUuid":"25e06912-08a2-40e4-af76-cfbc5ada9925","parentUuid":"0d64d3c6-4312-47a9-92ad-0bc9440d6e45","uuid":"20620ac3-9934-445a-9e24-38f781fbcbc2"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"This is unacceptable","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:05:59Z","entityUuid":"44810299-8618-4a79-a732-13cc2ff21903","parentUuid":"25e06912-08a2-40e4-af76-cfbc5ada9925","uuid":"0d359374-081c-4018-848d-174662b146ca"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"All essential data is also stored elsewhere","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:00Z","entityUuid":"766e16e4-21c7-4030-9eda-1973f51061d4","parentUuid":"25e06912-08a2-40e4-af76-cfbc5ada9925","uuid":"5386a116-7909-4bf1-9be4-430c35575ae0"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"Is there software in the work space? Can it also be restored quickly?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:01Z","entityUuid":"19640692-1c97-4574-8b3d-f4f6e1e6b564","parentUuid":"766e16e4-21c7-4030-9eda-1973f51061d4","uuid":"9c23351e-2a54-4862-8e54-a1ad99ff62fa"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","referenceType":"ResourcePageReference","resourcePageUuid":null},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:02Z","entityUuid":"4b9261db-1a1d-42c1-a147-f3951338be36","parentUuid":"19640692-1c97-4574-8b3d-f4f6e1e6b564","uuid":"ac9d6dd5-5980-4011-9e3f-6e34ea37216b"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"There is no software","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:03Z","entityUuid":"7b572fda-9d67-44e9-b1c3-6dfc42c34d89","parentUuid":"19640692-1c97-4574-8b3d-f4f6e1e6b564","uuid":"4e3e5c5d-bafd-4b51-9794-90e65c5388bf"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Software in the work space is only a copy","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:04Z","entityUuid":"1217ef1b-01fd-48e6-900d-60edb99b4621","parentUuid":"19640692-1c97-4574-8b3d-f4f6e1e6b564","uuid":"31ac016a-1a41-4a61-be5e-697ff3893812"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Special care will be taken for the software and configurations","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:05Z","entityUuid":"af2e1ca5-9a21-4c3b-a973-e9f41fd613da","parentUuid":"19640692-1c97-4574-8b3d-f4f6e1e6b564","uuid":"e74c1d5e-6bf0-48bc-ba16-bddc1f1222c9"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"Can you handle it when the work space is off line for a while?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:06Z","entityUuid":"0548db0c-bd34-40ce-be73-7a13a5e8eb7d","parentUuid":"0d64d3c6-4312-47a9-92ad-0bc9440d6e45","uuid":"96fd13ff-23e9-48dc-bc5e-aa77a05a7bee"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"We could handle a few days of offline time per year","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:07Z","entityUuid":"ef611a20-d5f9-4ea6-bb02-a7122bfd7eed","parentUuid":"0548db0c-bd34-40ce-be73-7a13a5e8eb7d","uuid":"c9d7f7bd-6f1a-4e53-8bbb-6ff15b570c2b"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"We can only miss the work space for a few hours during work hours","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:08Z","entityUuid":"d96d5e47-aec8-4576-9e3a-734ab58dfe62","parentUuid":"0548db0c-bd34-40ce-be73-7a13a5e8eb7d","uuid":"a69fc09d-4df2-49a6-8d94-a201cf07bcd6"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Problems during the evenings and weekends can not wait for work hours to be repaired","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:09Z","entityUuid":"b6da4858-f72c-498b-a827-d4632a458098","parentUuid":"0548db0c-bd34-40ce-be73-7a13a5e8eb7d","uuid":"69812429-be94-4dbc-aed5-185c9c909fc5"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"How long can you wait for a restore if the storage fails?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:10Z","entityUuid":"6531dd45-f628-4aa7-a2c5-82c639b79ab8","parentUuid":"0d64d3c6-4312-47a9-92ad-0bc9440d6e45","uuid":"13fce829-70e2-4618-ba71-271034a60e5a"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"We can wait for repair and a restore","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:11Z","entityUuid":"c9d8c9ed-ba2d-4108-b798-493cdf9225df","parentUuid":"6531dd45-f628-4aa7-a2c5-82c639b79ab8","uuid":"c494b040-eac5-4294-a6bc-211c91d763e5"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"A spare copy needs to be deployed quickly","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:12Z","entityUuid":"27db87e3-46b2-4705-b98c-47ddf4b4cd56","parentUuid":"6531dd45-f628-4aa7-a2c5-82c639b79ab8","uuid":"fb9b4032-a3f4-4ca4-bd34-6a2fc46a616f"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No waiting is possible, a hot copy must be ready to take over","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:13Z","entityUuid":"5797b252-0550-46e1-bf13-c65edd2df45e","parentUuid":"6531dd45-f628-4aa7-a2c5-82c639b79ab8","uuid":"b436a79b-cba8-45f3-809f-1e6708e49df3"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"How long can you wait for a restore if you accidentally damage a file?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:14Z","entityUuid":"aacf28a0-aab9-4436-8b2b-95ef755ae32a","parentUuid":"0d64d3c6-4312-47a9-92ad-0bc9440d6e45","uuid":"a227cc82-cd1b-4e4f-8487-a7cff9ac0791"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Days","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:15Z","entityUuid":"42fb53ea-76ed-494b-8582-f080d952a3ed","parentUuid":"aacf28a0-aab9-4436-8b2b-95ef755ae32a","uuid":"4b498a00-fe90-4b79-a67e-6ed80d9ed079"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Hours","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:16Z","entityUuid":"91463928-1cf4-43e0-bb4e-d1fc7b077ac8","parentUuid":"aacf28a0-aab9-4436-8b2b-95ef755ae32a","uuid":"d95ecdb2-8307-43ae-892b-6e11f3f891f0"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Any user needs to be able to restore an old copy instantaneously","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:17Z","entityUuid":"a639ec31-e226-404e-97fb-567d2f52e321","parentUuid":"aacf28a0-aab9-4436-8b2b-95ef755ae32a","uuid":"dd33ec0e-1070-4635-be66-1400da1f9c93"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"Are there any data files e.g. on laptops of project members? Also: supercomputing centers and other high performance computer centers often write in their terms of use that you need to take care of your own backups","title":"Will you make backup copies of project data that is not in the work space?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:18Z","entityUuid":"98d9789b-32fc-4e2f-876a-47760ad7c7ec","parentUuid":"0d64d3c6-4312-47a9-92ad-0bc9440d6e45","uuid":"67d8226b-fe49-425e-b4f7-13993a0da449"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"This is left to the project participants","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0,"metricUuid":"8845fe2b-79df-4138-baea-3a035bf5e249","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:19Z","entityUuid":"7c732053-6df4-466b-8732-0db2bd1e1ffc","parentUuid":"98d9789b-32fc-4e2f-876a-47760ad7c7ec","uuid":"06eb7a0b-e310-4c53-95e5-ea9b5242916f"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"There is no data elsewhere","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:20Z","entityUuid":"a1ead63a-1bc8-42e6-8bdc-3e1e8a901307","parentUuid":"98d9789b-32fc-4e2f-876a-47760ad7c7ec","uuid":"0b8bcfcf-4a19-40db-bceb-fd5c62a61ce6"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"All data elsewhere is adequately backed up","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0.8,"metricUuid":"8845fe2b-79df-4138-baea-3a035bf5e249","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:21Z","entityUuid":"278810f9-6396-4203-9fa6-6cd3a003159c","parentUuid":"98d9789b-32fc-4e2f-876a-47760ad7c7ec","uuid":"6236da4a-9472-47fe-9ee8-62ab385c2f76"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"We make (automated) backups of all data stored outside of the working area","metricMeasures":[{"measure":1,"metricUuid":"8845fe2b-79df-4138-baea-3a035bf5e249","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:22Z","entityUuid":"0884ac19-9bde-4bf1-afdd-0794c2c69092","parentUuid":"98d9789b-32fc-4e2f-876a-47760ad7c7ec","uuid":"bd817e3f-3576-4832-bb08-c4d5d9b716c5"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"There are many factors that can contribute to the risk of information loss or information leaks. They are often part of the behavior of the people that are involved in the project, but can also be steered by properly planned infrastructure.","title":"Is the risk of information loss, leaks and vandalism acceptably low?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:23Z","entityUuid":"614ab69d-55a6-4214-b384-00ba21ce92a1","parentUuid":"b1df3c74-0b1f-4574-81c4-4cc2d780c1af","uuid":"433155ef-11f1-432d-b02d-426442c31ec1"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Explore","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:24Z","entityUuid":"b2f76c0a-847a-403c-9ed6-09cad10e625e","parentUuid":"614ab69d-55a6-4214-b384-00ba21ce92a1","uuid":"5b52d4c4-84ea-4231-bcdd-26f3fbc44b51"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"When assessing the risk, take into account who has access to the lab, who has (physical) access to the computer hardware itself. Also consider whether data on those systems is properly backed up","title":"Do project members store data or software on computers in the lab or external hard drives connected to those computers?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:25Z","entityUuid":"90324a7b-f3c9-4ed8-b301-edc9869cb7b3","parentUuid":"b2f76c0a-847a-403c-9ed6-09cad10e625e","uuid":"ed216332-9137-4bab-9cad-3e96e89fe5ca"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0,"metricUuid":"0feac7e6-add4-4723-abae-be5ce7864c63","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:26Z","entityUuid":"17172079-ddce-40a7-b93a-f86dc6611452","parentUuid":"90324a7b-f3c9-4ed8-b301-edc9869cb7b3","uuid":"e8af5eb3-8812-489f-9d78-f12794aa8029"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes","metricMeasures":[{"measure":1,"metricUuid":"0feac7e6-add4-4723-abae-be5ce7864c63","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:27Z","entityUuid":"7134876a-bd96-44dd-b483-a0089bb1e5be","parentUuid":"90324a7b-f3c9-4ed8-b301-edc9869cb7b3","uuid":"abccffd0-8671-4f92-adf2-c5f63aeced04"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"Does anyone carry project data on laptops, USB sticks or other external media?","title":"Do project members carry data with them?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:28Z","entityUuid":"abaf4a70-17d4-449c-9b95-5b3bcfed7e9b","parentUuid":"b2f76c0a-847a-403c-9ed6-09cad10e625e","uuid":"9c11386e-5d66-46d8-8fd7-4c382ebc8a47"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No","metricMeasures":[{"measure":1,"metricUuid":"8845fe2b-79df-4138-baea-3a035bf5e249","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:29Z","entityUuid":"3c8f999d-c962-42a4-a7c3-05b21a4029ab","parentUuid":"abaf4a70-17d4-449c-9b95-5b3bcfed7e9b","uuid":"f7203505-9cc5-40d6-891a-b669c113f812"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:30Z","entityUuid":"c9fc7d94-0f37-40af-9d12-7c828d1252fc","parentUuid":"abaf4a70-17d4-449c-9b95-5b3bcfed7e9b","uuid":"c384fbec-0a56-4869-bb8e-1c8e30af4369"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"Are all data carriers encrypted? Are accounts on the laptop password protected?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:31Z","entityUuid":"6aff9a57-acea-4f6d-ac98-9a067e03cc8e","parentUuid":"c9fc7d94-0f37-40af-9d12-7c828d1252fc","uuid":"bb98a6bb-f0f7-461c-82f8-32d461f187f9"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0,"metricUuid":"8845fe2b-79df-4138-baea-3a035bf5e249","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:32Z","entityUuid":"546d6e41-80ea-417b-b0e3-a1d9d75a3794","parentUuid":"6aff9a57-acea-4f6d-ac98-9a067e03cc8e","uuid":"e3658e2e-7589-4737-8816-e2a0689cda1e"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0.5,"metricUuid":"8845fe2b-79df-4138-baea-3a035bf5e249","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:33Z","entityUuid":"dda8513e-431d-474e-b00d-107ae995e0ee","parentUuid":"6aff9a57-acea-4f6d-ac98-9a067e03cc8e","uuid":"c65ccf2d-16af-4520-959d-5e21be0e67ed"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"Think about services like Dropbox, but also about Google Drive, Apple iCloud accounts, or Microsoft's Office365","title":"Do project members store project data in cloud accounts?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:34Z","entityUuid":"84ec46bd-e714-4d98-8525-cdd0d58777ef","parentUuid":"b2f76c0a-847a-403c-9ed6-09cad10e625e","uuid":"2be52524-f571-4b32-8857-2cb43c628379"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:06:35Z","entityUuid":"099bfaa6-157a-49e5-8ef7-dad0876654f7","parentUuid":"84ec46bd-e714-4d98-8525-cdd0d58777ef","uuid":"2aa75469-e1c8-4183-95f8-aec1aa0be23c"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes","metric