ying or network delays are considered to be acceptable","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:07:27Z","entityUuid":"acec64f8-f20b-4295-85d6-a8831ee6a1a3","parentUuid":"a39fb276-8c46-49e7-bfb9-af8ba876726f","uuid":"fcec1dd7-00eb-4996-b47b-9a680459ca68"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"We will be able to use a dedicated network connection","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:07:28Z","entityUuid":"b477c114-fa99-41db-aa52-b63c36ce662d","parentUuid":"a39fb276-8c46-49e7-bfb9-af8ba876726f","uuid":"9f8ebae2-d53f-432a-b6ee-3edb1b5a744d"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"Are the risks of data leaks covered?","title":"Can all data be legally transported and processed at the computing site?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:07:29Z","entityUuid":"3788d53f-c79f-43d2-b67b-7479f05cddb0","parentUuid":"c536e726-722c-428a-b11b-25c763da1a54","uuid":"f2fabefd-4479-4bb2-8201-66d3012a23ce"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:07:30Z","entityUuid":"e208ad3c-97e0-45b3-93cf-646bde4b7b45","parentUuid":"3788d53f-c79f-43d2-b67b-7479f05cddb0","uuid":"8dc8626c-daa1-4325-8d8f-17d55a982a8e"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:07:31Z","entityUuid":"bd3c4a00-eeb5-4b8e-a3e3-a8f5c77e9745","parentUuid":"3788d53f-c79f-43d2-b67b-7479f05cddb0","uuid":"f57884c7-4de5-4fc8-a325-98a3311ec71a"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:07:32Z","entityUuid":"d439ecac-d31f-45eb-a04f-42a326e383ca","parentUuid":"4c71d62c-3184-43d7-bdec-f762c682035e","uuid":"eb2e8bd0-d8e7-4f7d-a210-ce3c1a466247"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"Will different groups work on different parts of the workflow? Will parts of the computing be done on 'local' infrastructure to the group?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:07:33Z","entityUuid":"410f3709-c283-4974-83c8-6c5d24899a68","parentUuid":"ae82cfc8-6b5f-4f06-a969-d430db181ac5","uuid":"f9a34d41-b851-48bf-9950-58395cc278f5"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"description":"Copying data into and out of the main working area of the project","eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","referenceType":"CrossReference","targetUuid":"f14750e9-3a39-4aae-b2c8-845583934c1d"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:07:34Z","entityUuid":"468bad94-ef86-4d24-8e97-d635fb1f68b0","parentUuid":"410f3709-c283-4974-83c8-6c5d24899a68","uuid":"332ccbf2-e45e-4e25-98bf-a786d347ba6c"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"All steps of the workflow will be performed at central computing locations","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:07:35Z","entityUuid":"be99bdcc-76f2-43c3-b277-064062360dc1","parentUuid":"410f3709-c283-4974-83c8-6c5d24899a68","uuid":"472781f6-344f-4399-a92f-07d6dc18e904"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Some steps may be performed at local computing locations","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:07:36Z","entityUuid":"a2c4514b-61e4-47cf-ae54-7006fea37ec2","parentUuid":"410f3709-c283-4974-83c8-6c5d24899a68","uuid":"a8fb5859-6d06-4f2e-b63c-5385e13f6bbf"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"Is there sufficient network capacity to the other computing locations?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:07:37Z","entityUuid":"9e34d326-5f7b-494b-bc2e-2131eef6f844","parentUuid":"a2c4514b-61e4-47cf-ae54-7006fea37e