","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"What software will you be using to collect all data?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:06Z","entityUuid":"2e394765-d87d-4c1e-9f90-d8d2a06826e3","parentUuid":"b24b7cbe-2209-47e9-87d6-401fbfb3cdec","uuid":"8e803b69-44b3-48da-b9ce-ed8f2aaa56ce"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"We will not use a data warehouse","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:07Z","entityUuid":"ffcb476b-8321-42d6-84fb-8347fcff1011","parentUuid":"2e394765-d87d-4c1e-9f90-d8d2a06826e3","uuid":"dded3aeb-ee33-4557-99be-950d567c0886"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"TranSMART","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:08Z","entityUuid":"cce63dc5-5ac7-4706-ab5a-4a204ef380e3","parentUuid":"2e394765-d87d-4c1e-9f90-d8d2a06826e3","uuid":"9701df98-d73c-4406-b61b-613c3c5d632d"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Software not listed here","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:09Z","entityUuid":"aa23e0c5-45ca-4061-9e81-04fc9d56c97c","parentUuid":"2e394765-d87d-4c1e-9f90-d8d2a06826e3","uuid":"b21c778a-f9da-4310-866a-ef6128bc822e"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"We will develop our own","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:10Z","entityUuid":"2be7a50f-f044-4649-a163-2197a13e5edc","parentUuid":"2e394765-d87d-4c1e-9f90-d8d2a06826e3","uuid":"c165a4e2-580f-4664-8747-f4b139b04ca9"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"Why will you develop your own software?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:11Z","entityUuid":"677c07f0-a709-4d77-946f-78735a88c858","parentUuid":"2be7a50f-f044-4649-a163-2197a13e5edc","uuid":"c272be0d-63c7-4551-a97d-a861571c04dd"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Nothing like this has ever been done before","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:12Z","entityUuid":"2bfd3b78-6013-42b3-ba13-51041aac5618","parentUuid":"677c07f0-a709-4d77-946f-78735a88c858","uuid":"5e847ec4-0f43-402e-82d9-faaeb064723a"},{"content":{"advice":"Did you consider collaborating to improve an existing solution?","annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Existing solutions are not suitable","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:13Z","entityUuid":"62028d39-f35d-4b09-ad7a-a0772d45573e","parentUuid":"677c07f0-a709-4d77-946f-78735a88c858","uuid":"f4c4b95a-6391-4d78-8e9b-cf2bb2cab55e"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddChapterEvent","text":"","title":"Data processing and curation"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:14Z","entityUuid":"10a10ffd-bfe1-4c6b-bbb6-3dfb1e63a5d5","parentUuid":"6f6241d9-136c-4770-9d58-8a3f39607052","uuid":"819cb1b1-d84f-48d3-9ac2-ce29c4f1a291"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"It is likely that you will be developing or modifying the workflow for data processing. There are a lot of aspects of this workflow that can play a role in your data management, such as the use of an existing work flow engine, the use of existing software vs development of new components, and whether every run needs human intervention or whether all data processing can be run in bulk once the work flow has been defined.","title":"Workflow development"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:15Z","entityUuid":"4ba3304e-225c-4916-bbf7-754de381253c","parentUuid":"10a10ffd-bfe1-4c6b-bbb6-3dfb1e63a5d5","uuid":"888bd221-46e3-4ab8-af42-712640b53752"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"This has been arranged","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:16Z","entityUuid":"4d74014e-588d-4a1d-a343-9bc3a4d72e25","parentUuid":"4ba3304e-225c-4916-bbf7-754de381253c","uuid":"49fe725d-63be-46cb-85a3-2783000430de"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"More guidance is desired","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:17Z","entityUuid":"bb00eb32-e1c2-4288-a874-02264f757cb3","parentUuid":"4ba3304e-225c-4916-bbf7-754de381253c","uuid":"17ce8a9a-c839-4806-9919-0c40ed56da6c"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"What will be the operational mode for your workflows? Will you be exploring options by changing tools and tweaking parameters? Of will you be running the same exact workflow on a large number of data files?","title":"Will you be exploring parameters to the workflow, or run in bulk?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:18Z","entityUuid":"13c2a033-423c-4bb3-b596-840de2f6c9c9","parentUuid":"bb00eb32-e1c2-4288-a874-02264f757cb3","uuid":"05775623-ba4e-487c-b417-f4334d8b4155"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","referenceType":"ResourcePageReference","resourcePageUuid":null},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:19Z","entityUuid":"b5091903-f8fc-4dbe-8e12-34f0b754e04d","parentUuid":"13c2a033-423c-4bb3-b596-840de2f6c9c9","uuid":"e23cc8ef-616d-4c61-9ad5-e0f043468161"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"We will be exploring parameters to the workflow","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:20Z","entityUuid":"ec5b49f0-2a91-47fa-aee2-9636b8f9f2d0","parentUuid":"13c2a033-423c-4bb3-b596-840de2f6c9c9","uuid":"9a017778-782a-46d0-b5e9-0950c921b22b"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"We will be running in bulk","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:21Z","entityUuid":"a91af528-0ab7-4b23-8b27-b131a7731dce","parentUuid":"13c2a033-423c-4bb3-b596-840de2f6c9c9","uuid":"06a34eb0-515e-49c5-9081-37e30c893b5d"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"A bit of both","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:22Z","entityUuid":"f357ae1a-6563-48dd-add2-580e1f1a565d","parentUuid":"13c2a033-423c-4bb3-b596-840de2f6c9c9","uuid":"8f37329c-3529-4021-b3dd-ad0eeb6cd7d8"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"The people implementing the data analysis work flow for your project probably need test data that they can use to see whether what they build works. How will this be arranged?","title":"What data will the workflow developers or implementers use?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:23Z","entityUuid":"14ed71a8-80c6-465a-94db-1115502297bd","parentUuid":"bb00eb32-e1c2-4288-a874-02264f757cb3","uuid":"219592a8-ebbe-4bcc-8ad8-cbe89ebb2997"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"They do not need data","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:24Z","entityUuid":"e8779d3b-8292-429e-a9b1-3df49c495674","parentUuid":"14ed71a8-80c6-465a-94db-1115502297bd","uuid":"55336070-4de6-44ec-a35b-39e12193faaa"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"They can use existing data from another project","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:25Z","entityUuid":"9d7f9c48-0907-4798-b7bd-454505a54b1a","parentUuid":"14ed71a8-80c6-465a-94db-1115502297bd","uuid":"d15a5892-dfee-4814-8c5a-7813a93f3070"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"They can use data from our project","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:26Z","entityUuid":"3996826a-b67a-42e7-9223-f2a438fddbe6","parentUuid":"14ed71a8-80c6-465a-94db-1115502297bd","uuid":"9ef0dbf0-6a76-48b2-86f1-c35dbc53761a"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"When will they have access?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:27Z","entityUuid":"c56f2e8f-bb78-412e-b238-974a14482f28","parentUuid":"3996826a-b67a-42e7-9223-f2a438fddbe6","uuid":"5ae6e215-3102-42ab-a463-fdede4735bb1"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Data will be available at the start of the project, no waiting needed","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:28Z","entityUuid":"94f0f330-54fd-425f-a644-b8a7c674026f","parentUuid":"c56f2e8f-bb78-412e-b238-974a14482f28","uuid":"9eb0aaa7-fbc7-4d58-82b0-00a838899fb0"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"They can start with a subset as soon as our first data comes","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:29Z","entityUuid":"4844d32a-be6a-490a-b12e-3a31503d7bd1","parentUuid":"c56f2e8f-bb78-412e-b238-974a14482f28","uuid":"1ba50cb6-1ea0-4009-a5d4-280d9acb905b"},{"content":{"advice":"Take this into account when doing the time planning for the critical path","annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Workflow development will commence as soon as our data is available","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:30Z","entityUuid":"e5bc08e1-815f-44f6-94ea-3a32e1808d51","parentUuid":"c56f2e8f-bb78-412e-b238-974a14482f28","uuid":"33a4f3d4-483c-4f37-9ae4-855271056aaf"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"How will data security be dealt with?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:31Z","entityUuid":"d206fcaf-a238-48ef-925e-6f006d39f2af","parentUuid":"3996826a-b67a-42e7-9223-f2a438fddbe6","uuid":"0b5eceb7-2597-4d0c-950d-dcf06db70e4a"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Data security is not an issue","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:32Z","entityUuid":"01a9f738-7950-4ee0-b9d0-ecd0df8fa7f2","parentUuid":"d206fcaf-a238-48ef-925e-6f006d39f2af","uuid":"e18505e5-6d15-45f9-b2e8-6394e37c0e29"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Data will not be on systems owned by workflow developers","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:33Z","entityUuid":"2359684e-be7f-4990-8f2e-84079ceb48c3","parentUuid":"d206fcaf-a238-48ef-925e-6f006d39f2af","uuid":"6ba94c1c-04b8-4d51-92ce-70dad752cdfe"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Data will always be encrypted","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:34Z","entityUuid":"340ae978-4435-4b20-87bf-0d65d82ac7b2","parentUuid":"d206fcaf-a238-48ef-925e-6f006d39f2af","uuid":"f5821520-1204-4111-ad67-a7b6a95b2db1"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"We have made other arrangements","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:35Z","entityUuid":"a3286c6a-ce1b-4ff0-8cee-9686d0bd1e72","parentUuid":"d206fcaf-a238-48ef-925e-6f006d39f2af","uuid":"b461cd21-cf50-4c73-859d-0271e66cd0d7"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"ValueQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"What other arrangements?","validations":[],"valueType":"TextQuestionValueType"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:36Z","entityUuid":"4bf93fbc-1116-4d40-b2fb-625a0e2e20f9","parentUuid":"a3286c6a-ce1b-4ff0-8cee-9686d0bd1e72","uuid":"3ce44e27-b5b3-4cdb-afc9-c5d007ed3703"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"ListQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"Your workflow may be available in components from different sources. Specify the different parts that you recognize and that you will each acquire in a different way","title":"List existing software components you will use in the analysis workflow"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:37Z","entityUuid":"9a1c0153-3eae-40d5-8e91-66e108ef1fe8","parentUuid":"bb00eb32-e1c2-4288-a874-02264f757cb3","uuid":"e47d79fa-a204-4f23-8aa5-34ab8e240df4"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"ValueQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"Where are you getting this software from? Please specify a web address if available.","validations":[],"valueType":"TextQuestionValueType"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:38Z","entityUuid":"996df4e8-90ea-4aaf-8c3d-d92b3d145dd3","parentUuid":"9a1c0153-3eae-40d5-8e91-66e108ef1fe8","uuid":"e19e3b4b-f71c-4b61-b289-dc5fd4ab5807"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"What version of this software will you use?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:39Z","entityUuid":"cfb67fc9-4a65-4221-87ca-7ca7c99f13a4","parentUuid":"9a1c0153-3eae-40d5-8e91-66e108ef1fe8","uuid":"175ff440-3805-47f4-9b86-2530c973ce12"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"The exact version that we point to","metricMeasures":[{"measure":1,"metricUuid":"0bafe0c2-a8f2-4c74-80c8-dbf3a5b8e9b7","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:40Z","entityUuid":"d707aef1-856d-4ab1-903a-2bccdd0c9a65","parentUuid":"cfb67fc9-4a65-4221-87ca-7ca7c99f13a4","uuid":"9eec8a7b-ecd8-4f9b-87dd-5119c26ec687"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"The current version, and we will stick with that","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0.8,"metricUuid":"0bafe0c2-a8f2-4c74-80c8-dbf3a5b8e9b7","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:41Z","entityUuid":"6730b8b5-7abe-41e5-b97c-08e1f32fb523","parentUuid":"cfb67fc9-4a65-4221-87ca-7ca7c99f13a4","uuid":"77fda252-34bf-4d30-a7db-3b62ddda3d0c"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Whatever is the latest version at the time the analysis is run","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0.5,"metricUuid":"0bafe0c2-a8f2-4c74-80c8-dbf3a5b8e9b7","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:42Z","entityUuid":"e3e4240a-0785-4a76-9dd6-ce073abf643b","parentUuid":"cfb67fc9-4a65-4221-87ca-7ca7c99f13a4","uuid":"320db135-cf05-4a7a-aba6-2e2a19956b89"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"Will you re-run any analysis when a new version comes out?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:43Z","entityUuid":"b482e4e9-9435-4e2c-9ce5-e35845ba53b0","parentUuid":"e3e4240a-0785-4a76-9dd6-ce073abf643b","uuid":"9647d61b-ab0c-40c6-bfd5-2da39ae6bace"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:44Z","entityUuid":"8a3adc2b-cef2-43a1-8552-644acc3939a7","parentUuid":"b482e4e9-9435-4e2c-9ce5-e35845ba53b0","uuid":"43ec9a3f-0377-4782-950e-cc3248b5db84"},{"content":{"advice":"Make sure to take that into account when calculating the need for compute resources","annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"If there is potentially a better result","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:45Z","entityUuid":"de969453-db1e-48b3-9024-6ed9fc23152f","parentUuid":"b482e4e9-9435-4e2c-9ce5-e35845ba53b0","uuid":"5ee0c3ea-f3dd-4d65-8bfd-a482fedde9f6"},{"content":{"advice":"Make sure to take that into account when calculating the need for compute resources","annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:09:46Z","entityUuid":"7e0cd029-7588-4a94-9bfc-506dda26066d","parentUuid":"b482e4e9-9435-4e2c-9ce5-e35845ba53b0","uuid":"fe2b5890-e938-463e-9546-0b3183412b39"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQue