lueQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"What other reasons are there not to open all data immediately?","validations":[],"valueType":"TextQuestionValueType"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:17Z","entityUuid":"b289fdcc-aedc-496e-8169-e0bbe2346d1f","parentUuid":"2b755a90-8a43-41c0-9020-5e2b9ca8f88e","uuid":"c374a917-a972-4abe-8a15-889520e9ed90"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"Will you use a limited embargo?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:18Z","entityUuid":"f5c12fcf-15d0-44ba-a53c-49ea9d7f620f","parentUuid":"b3739ebd-2d8e-42d3-9425-a7d6d1b26c79","uuid":"97b53afc-b2f6-449a-821b-1c8b88b6493c"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No, some restricted data will be embargoed indefinitely","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0,"metricUuid":"cc02c5a0-9754-4432-a7e0-ce0f3cf7a0a0","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:19Z","entityUuid":"3da39a55-18e5-4b0a-8da1-5b7fc5260ad1","parentUuid":"f5c12fcf-15d0-44ba-a53c-49ea9d7f620f","uuid":"4368e48c-2dd2-4439-8e9f-5795af2b4506"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"ValueQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"What is the maximum embargo period?","validations":[],"valueType":"TextQuestionValueType"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:20Z","entityUuid":"b51a276b-3c57-40ef-bacc-0130d56db965","parentUuid":"3da39a55-18e5-4b0a-8da1-5b7fc5260ad1","uuid":"6489c81b-a2f5-497a-aef3-cb15adda3505"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No, data will be released only as soon as restrictions are falling away","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0.5,"metricUuid":"cc02c5a0-9754-4432-a7e0-ce0f3cf7a0a0","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:21Z","entityUuid":"82f84d7e-338c-46bc-9785-42df560c01ed","parentUuid":"f5c12fcf-15d0-44ba-a53c-49ea9d7f620f","uuid":"1dce58e0-a3d7-49e9-a498-f51033b4aa38"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes, data that is not legally restrained will be released after a fixed time period, unconditionally","metricMeasures":[{"measure":1,"metricUuid":"cc02c5a0-9754-4432-a7e0-ce0f3cf7a0a0","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:22Z","entityUuid":"1b120967-803b-458b-b565-dbee6a785509","parentUuid":"f5c12fcf-15d0-44ba-a53c-49ea9d7f620f","uuid":"d534a038-a42f-4347-81f1-4461568a9674"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes","metricMeasures":[{"measure":1,"metricUuid":"cc02c5a0-9754-4432-a7e0-ce0f3cf7a0a0","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:23Z","entityUuid":"8c33553c-9603-4156-82d7-85ab3d7de090","parentUuid":"a549d10b-aa46-4c0c-863f-30219ac5ecce","uuid":"53693121-f329-464c-8069-6e4a9734920c"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"ListQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"Specify a short name for each data set, sufficient for yourself to know what data it is about. It is useful to think about a data set as some collection of data that will be ending up in the same place.","title":"Specify a list of data sets you will be publishing"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:24Z","entityUuid":"4e0c1edf-660c-4ebf-81f5-9fa959dead30","parentUuid":"6be88f7c-f868-460f-bba7-91e1c659adfd","uuid":"91271efa-a472-4fb4-ba4c-2fc12a7640ec"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"Domain repositories often have the best functionality to make the data findable and reusable. Many of them are listed in https://fairsharing,org/","title":"What kind of repository will this data be stored in?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:25Z","entityUuid":"80a682bd-8a5c-4a52-935d-680509838a4e","parentUuid":"4e0c1edf-660c-4ebf-81f5-9fa959dead30","uuid":"27ea84b4-b6d3-49b4-b9e1-0c578ebd9603"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","label":"FAIRSharing","referenceType":"URLReference","url":"https://fairsharing.org/"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:26Z","entityUuid":"2e0ed21b-2180-4497-8c41-fd2609904400","parentUuid":"80a682bd-8a5c-4a52-935d-680509838a4e","uuid":"0a0c244a-8bb6-47a7-9823-7780dd8c64f4"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","label":"Registry of Research data Repositories","referenceType":"URLReference","url":"https://re3data.org/"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:27Z","entityUuid":"e83b0c27-e218-447b-bc0d-7041521e01a1","parentUuid":"80a682bd-8a5c-4a52-935d-680509838a4e","uuid":"1ccfa4f6-b538-4f05-891a-d60f5bebf050"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"A domain-specific repository","metricMeasures":[{"measure":1,"metricUuid":"8db30660-d4e5-4c0a-bf3e-553f3f0f997a","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:28Z","entityUuid":"1dc412c6-da92-4cc2-8639-316c0c6ec5ff","parentUuid":"80a682bd-8a5c-4a52-935d-680509838a4e","uuid":"de07cf67-4186-4af0-b5e5-a64253c1f549"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"ValueQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"What repository?","validations":[],"valueType":"TextQuestionValueType"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:29Z","entityUuid":"221c322e-dff5-438f-8a2e-90e762681156","parentUuid":"1dc412c6-da92-4cc2-8639-316c0c6ec5ff","uuid":"780c8cb5-e87c-4123-9139-e90668cf8eeb"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"Contacting the repository early may be useful to establish conditions, formats, and metadata requirements for submission. It may also be necessary to establish whether the repository can accommodate your data","title":"Will you contact the repository beforehand?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:30Z","entityUuid":"b1492627-9cb6-465a-945a-a2a7ff9a8189","parentUuid":"1dc412c6-da92-4cc2-8639-316c0c6ec5ff","uuid":"2ba0a3dd-6302-447f-9182-aa7a183b061c"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No, this submission is routine both for us and the repository","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:31Z","entityUuid":"c86c80b4-72b3-4194-956a-27e40d3c23eb","parentUuid":"b1492627-9cb6-465a-945a-a2a7ff9a8189","uuid":"9284e70b-a343-4c03-aa75-12fe10b6a824"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes, we have contacted the repository","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:32Z","entityUuid":"e09562c0-346c-4c95-b470-c5810aab18fa","parentUuid":"b1492627-9cb6-465a-945a-a2a7ff9a8189","uuid":"b91eb5f6-c1b9-4ed5-9da7-5929bce750ee"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes, we will contact the repository","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:33Z","entityUuid":"93c590a5-60a6-481d-9482-9145435143a2","parentUuid":"b1492627-9cb6-465a-945a-a2a7ff9a8189","uuid":"1b8ce50e-69d1-4fa1-ba8a-612bab9d50b5"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"We have made other arrangements","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:34Z","entityUuid":"620b1090-2a57-4f3c-b336-97c9e95da637","parentUuid":"b1492627-9cb6-465a-945a-a2a7ff9a8189","uuid":"fca0dd40-ce3d-43ac-9a20-ae26db078ad9"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"ValueQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"What other arrangements?","validations":[],"valueType":"TextQuestionValueType"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:35Z","entityUuid":"fc0857c1-e4d2-47f5-86b1-0292bfc7eecf","parentUuid":"620b1090-2a57-4f3c-b336-97c9e95da637","uuid":"e02bddb6-9e49-4063-8d0a-98817162318d"},{"content":{"advice":"Disadvantage of a general purpose repository is the lack of data-specific features (e.g. 'play' instead of 'download' for an audio file) and limited findability","annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Our national repository","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0.5,"metricUuid":"8db30660-d4e5-4c0a-bf3e-553f3f0f997a","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:36Z","entityUuid":"fb96d008-f31a-4a1a-b203-b3f9bb32fcc8","parentUuid":"80a682bd-8a5c-4a52-935d-680509838a4e","uuid":"235cd4d0-cf58-4562-8326-d4ad61c026f7"},{"content":{"advice":"Disadvantage of a general purpose repository is the lack of data-specific features (e.g. 'play' instead of 'download' for an audio file) and limited findability","annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Our institutional repository","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0.5,"metricUuid":"8db30660-d4e5-4c0a-bf3e-553f3f0f997a","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:37Z","entityUuid":"df0b2ee3-8e4d-42a1-9bb2-c69228074406","parentUuid":"80a682bd-8a5c-4a52-935d-680509838a4e","uuid":"eb8581e1-5a64-48f5-9d32-12f2c2e8552d"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"A special-purpose repository for the project","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0,"metricUuid":"8db30660-d4e5-4c0a-bf3e-553f3f0f997a","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:38Z","entityUuid":"afd9f4d5-20e0-4fa0-a42a-376c132ff5b0","parentUuid":"80a682bd-8a5c-4a52-935d-680509838a4e","uuid":"db775a15-2894-482d-8e70-8b2576b5dd79"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"Maintaining a repository is a long term commitment that can most of the time not be funded from project money. Think about who will be doing the system maintenance, hardware maintenance, and who will make necessary code changes to accommodate future (safe) versions of the system","title":"Will you be able to support this repository for a sufficiently long time?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:39Z","entityUuid":"f83a9afd-c6de-452b-be9f-bd76e5eb6b54","parentUuid":"afd9f4d5-20e0-4fa0-a42a-376c132ff5b0","uuid":"717e225d-7951-4b1b-8c41-13e2ebfba171"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0,"metricUuid":"0feac7e6-add4-4723-abae-be5ce7864c63","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:40Z","entityUuid":"dc921fac-cf77-4d3d-bb9c-907d37f838ef","parentUuid":"f83a9afd-c6de-452b-be9f-bd76e5eb6b54","uuid":"5ab79b62-62c0-488a-9140-7cab37431aae"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes","metricMeasures":[{"measure":1,"metricUuid":"0feac7e6-add4-4723-abae-be5ce7864c63","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:41Z","entityUuid":"714e0a22-c059-4f80-9780-6f7f2e2ce53b","parentUuid":"f83a9afd-c6de-452b-be9f-bd76e5eb6b54","uuid":"976923b3-4af9-48f2-9b82-47867a1d98d7"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"The amount of funding needed to maintain a repository is strongly dependent on the services offered","title":"What is the service level you will be offering to users of the data/repository?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:42Z","entityUuid":"cbbfb0da-caf1-4c04-b72f-de39c4a8fb33","parentUuid":"afd9f4d5-20e0-4fa0-a42a-376c132ff5b0","uuid":"d3f847ee-738c-4df2-95ba-128f5d05a39e"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","referenceType":"ResourcePageReference","resourcePageUuid":null},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:43Z","entityUuid":"8ec39b4c-0a3b-4267-9932-0c73b5f1eecd","parentUuid":"cbbfb0da-caf1-4c04-b72f-de39c4a8fb33","uuid":"eab61381-bf70-492d-942d-309d3b724823"},{"content":{"advice":"That functionality level can surely be found in another place too!","annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Download only","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:44Z","entityUuid":"dc1082fd-1c90-492c-833c-3e0909c643bb","parentUuid":"cbbfb0da-caf1-4c04-b72f-de39c4a8fb33","uuid":"6644d965-c198-4785-8dfd-1b1932bd5c02"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"A search and simple access interface","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:45Z","entityUuid":"da6725a2-62bb-4fe7-a76f-a4e396646b19","parentUuid":"cbbfb0da-caf1-4c04-b72f-de39c4a8fb33","uuid":"2a219fd6-afbe-4055-b648-ab5664dbd59c"},{"content":{"advice":"Make sure to budget sufficient compute resources for the users","annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"An advanced processing service","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:46Z","entityUuid":"d65ddfda-9b08-4ab6-90e5-07df748d7929","parentUuid":"cbbfb0da-caf1-4c04-b72f-de39c4a8fb33","uuid":"ed84cd61-1582-44ec-b85b-ab416aa8c18e"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"Did you arrange for system administration (at least security updates) and hardware maintenance for the server(s)?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:47Z","entityUuid":"f691ad73-1284-4c7d-999d-34bb0612dd42","parentUuid":"afd9f4d5-20e0-4fa0-a42a-376c132ff5b0","uuid":"42bf2b3c-0c43-4bde-8841-c7a8c7ba5999"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0,"metricUuid":"8845fe2b-79df-4138-baea-3a035bf5e249","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:48Z","entityUuid":"4dd69e44-097b-42fc-98a4-4ce379453d46","parentUuid":"f691ad73-1284-4c7d-999d-34bb0612dd42","uuid":"d0394da8-0d80-4ff5-92ea-e06eb58ed32b"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes","metricMeasures":[{"measure":1,"metricUuid":"8845fe2b-79df-4138-baea-3a035bf5e249","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:49Z","entityUuid":"d2c01a84-fc1d-4108-95c4-9e9e9198f93e","parentUuid":"f691ad73-1284-4c7d-999d-34bb0612dd42","uuid":"c553d6be-7eb3-4630-a194-93113bd0cfa7"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"Data is sometimes difficult to locate, especially if it is not in a domain-specific repository. Data catalogues may increase findability.","title":"Will you be adding a reference to the published data to at least one data catalogue?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:50Z","entityUuid":"46039bea-87e6-4c61-8567-4e819404b4d0","parentUuid":"4e0c1edf-660c-4ebf-81f5-9fa959dead30","uuid":"26d0a844-2e22-432c-a80b-08968a11632d"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0,"metricUuid":"8db30660-d4e5-4c0a-bf3e-553f3f0f997a","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:51Z","entityUuid":"0224af28-8272-4360-b8b2-0fcc835832e9","parentUuid":"46039bea-87e6-4c61-8567-4e819404b4d0","uuid":"e5843660-6246-47df-a9c8-733f96f3d6ec"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes","metricMeasures":[{"measure":1,"metricUuid":"8db30660-d4e5-4c0a-bf3e-553f3f0f997a","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:52Z","entityUuid":"9e39ea26-cdaf-483b-9502-d47fc4f69bab","parentUuid":"46039bea-87e6-4c61-8567-4e819404b4d0","uuid":"ec531106-8c47-4b73-b865-035a657aa114"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"Will you be making sure that blocks of data deposited in different repositories can be recognized as belonging to the same study?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:53Z","entityUuid":"92a10652-3675-48f2-8d50-180a29cec62e","parentUuid":"6be88f7c-f868-460f-bba7-91e1c659adfd","uuid":"2368bfc0-6e93-4061-9e87-66a638d4194b"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0,"metricUuid":"8db30660-d4e5-4c0a-bf3e-553f3f0f997a","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:54Z","entityUuid":"2f7e45cd-0f00-4228-865e-62f64ccde1b1","parentUuid":"92a10652-3675-48f2-8d50-180a29cec62e","uuid":"f9d8f33c-fd9e-4d9c-9cc8-a15b6195fe10"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes, all data sets will have links to the related data","metricMeasures":[{"measure":1,"metricUuid":"8db30660-d4e5-4c0a-bf3e-553f3f0f997a","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:55Z","entityUuid":"0e748d3d-fd83-470f-918a-0321b1fc9f11","parentUuid":"92a10652-3675-48f2-8d50-180a29cec62e","uuid":"b155f824-262d-42af-8dfa-7068c750bb33"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes, all data sets will be linked from a single catalog entry","metricMeasures":[{"measure":1,"metricUuid":"8db30660-d4e5-4c0a-bf3e-553f3f0f997a","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:56Z","entityUuid":"18ca5e47-464d-40c5-881b-c15e54bd2bff","parentUuid":"92a10652-3675-48f2-8d50-180a29cec62e","uuid":"b58dca2b-44e8-4eee-97b7-ddb5d18c2ec8"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes, we have made other arrangements","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:57Z","entityUuid":"6445c352-5685-4e23-ac52-ebcabe353bd0","parentUuid":"92a10652-3675-48f2-8d50-180a29cec62e","uuid":"cf10cba8-e853-4699-af06-4f51e90eea5a"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"ValueQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"What other arrangements?","validations":[],"valueType":"TextQuestionValueType"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:16:58Z","entityUuid":"1accb605-505a-488b-be74-26faa3e34e2b","parentUuid":"6445c352-5685-4e23-a