ed in the project","metricMeasures":[{"measure":1,"metricUuid":"cc02c5a0-9754-4432-a7e0-ce0f3cf7a0a0","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:17:04Z","entityUuid":"5b5d1c59-2e3a-4e1a-aafa-c2451c8e11da","parentUuid":"25e9fe5b-d8f7-4b43-a903-7809a571a2bb","uuid":"a51dd14d-f0f0-4059-9200-5f1968c34c6a"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes, our department/institute will pay for open access publishing","metricMeasures":[{"measure":1,"metricUuid":"cc02c5a0-9754-4432-a7e0-ce0f3cf7a0a0","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:17:05Z","entityUuid":"ef5e44f4-4902-4117-b783-59270cb327c9","parentUuid":"25e9fe5b-d8f7-4b43-a903-7809a571a2bb","uuid":"c624d091-ee8f-40ca-be0f-1b2c4064b105"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"Are you using any commercially licensed products to keep data, software or documents available, for which a regular fee must be paid?","title":"Are there any recurring fees to keep data or documents available?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:17:06Z","entityUuid":"4baf405e-262e-4f1a-bfdc-fe72fc628650","parentUuid":"6be88f7c-f868-460f-bba7-91e1c659adfd","uuid":"a2640f2c-af3a-48af-8637-511edab271c4"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:17:07Z","entityUuid":"ccbe8121-ac77-4619-a49d-5a755c01d5a2","parentUuid":"4baf405e-262e-4f1a-bfdc-fe72fc628650","uuid":"2066f35e-9b4a-49a5-b598-bc1a7be85755"},{"content":{"advice":"Make sure this will be kept running by the department or institute. It is best to also have a backup plan, being able to move data and documents to a different place if a service is discontinued. For this, you may need to arrange permission from all project partners beforehand.","annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:17:08Z","entityUuid":"5951120f-af93-4f15-b15a-b2be9a89efff","parentUuid":"4baf405e-262e-4f1a-bfdc-fe72fc628650","uuid":"30ae2e18-b8fc-47d8-941a-dca7550d7078"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"Will you be storing (in cold storage) copies of your own data for a longer period after the project has ended? Possibly as a continuation of archival as part of data storage strategy during the project? Data archival is distinct from data publishing, an archive is usually limited in who can access the data.","title":"Will you be archiving your data after the project in 'cold storage'?"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:17:09Z","entityUuid":"f9d84278-b61d-4314-94e9-12644bfa1d00","parentUuid":"6be88f7c-f868-460f-bba7-91e1c659adfd","uuid":"b4c41d8c-5899-4f4b-bbb1-f3f9649d457c"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","referenceType":"ResourcePageReference","resourcePageUuid":null},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:17:10Z","entityUuid":"658723a8-b622-4d11-bfa3-ac3ecfb6fc1b","parentUuid":"f9d84278-b61d-4314-94e9-12644bfa1d00","uuid":"6bd3b239-77a0-474b-9fd0-07c90523ced7"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"description":"Archival during the project","eventType":"AddReferenceEvent","referenceType":"CrossReference","targetUuid":"d5784d24-0e66-4821-bd62-a711fb6d7a40"},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:17:11Z","entityUuid":"4edaeeb8-0e4d-4ae7-b1c6-2e324bebdfd6","parentUuid":"f9d84278-b61d-4314-94e9-12644bfa1d00","uuid":"326283fc-9fe3-48cc-bcb0-4e8dca6ed344"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No","metricMeasures":[{"measure":0,"metricUuid":"8845fe2b-79df-4138-baea-3a035bf5e249","weight":1}]},"createdAt":"2018-10-01T00:17:12Z","entityUuid":"b6890d88-88e4-4667-8b28-82bc73c728be","parentUuid":"f9d84278-b61d-4314-94e9-12644bfa1d00","uuid":"a6c3e423-7ca0-4019-9567-700965f5466d"},{"content":{"advice":null,"