. readouts about the performance of an airplane are considered to contain personal data of the pilot!","title":"Does this dataset contain personal data?"},"createdAt":"2020-07-01T10:27:43Z","entityUuid":"a1d76760-053c-4706-80a2-cfb6c6a061f3","parentUuid":"4e0c1edf-660c-4ebf-81f5-9fa959dead30","uuid":"6b1c94b1-ee93-4835-8b6b-277c04c6b620"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"No","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2020-07-01T10:27:44Z","entityUuid":"4b2a08c7-4942-41fc-8114-d3868c882624","parentUuid":"a1d76760-053c-4706-80a2-cfb6c6a061f3","uuid":"f351f432-10e0-4581-8170-68b3ad6b3c50"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2020-07-01T10:27:45Z","entityUuid":"0cdc4817-7c54-4ec1-b2f4-5c007a85c7b8","parentUuid":"a1d76760-053c-4706-80a2-cfb6c6a061f3","uuid":"564d2600-e10a-479e-bdfb-92f653d35ff9"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":null,"tagUuids":[],"text":"Personal information can be sensitive if it is for instance about the health, sexual orientation, religion of a person. But there are also other classes of sensitive information: e.g. locations of rare species in biodiversity could be sensitive and should not leak to poachers.","title":"Does this dataset contain sensitive information?"},"createdAt":"2020-07-01T10:27:46Z","entityUuid":"cc95b399-7d8d-4232-bccf-686f78c91bff","parentUuid":"4e0c1edf-660c-4ebf-81f5-9fa959dead30","uuid":"fc00d471-4453-43ee-ad9c-3835476738d6"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"ListQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":[],"text":"Add each of the locations where this data set will be stored. Give each of these a short name that identifies it to yourself.","title":"Specify where you will keep and/or distribute this data from"},"createdAt":"2020-07-01T10:27:47Z","ent