e},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":true,"value":"b101f2d0-2476-452d-aa8d-95a41a02b52c"},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2020-11-11T10:53:39Z","entityUuid":"f87c331d-794a-42c8-a910-61a2a9110dab","parentUuid":"b1df3c74-0b1f-4574-81c4-4cc2d780c1af","uuid":"09443b40-3dd5-4a95-9908-eeb4263171d8"},{"content":{"eventType":"MoveQuestionEvent","targetUuid":"e4ca2d31-137a-46d3-96cd-3e9e8c5e9a76"},"createdAt":"2020-11-11T10:53:40Z","entityUuid":"f5fef09d-ade5-4019-b089-f05bd89c34bc","parentUuid":"b1df3c74-0b1f-4574-81c4-4cc2d780c1af","uuid":"15769653-c333-48be-8c8f-a2aafb516d54"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"itemTemplateQuestionUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ListQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Specify what data sets you will acquire using measurement equipment"}},"createdAt":"2020-11-11T10:53:41Z","entityUuid":"f5fef09d-ade5-4019-b089-f05bd89c34bc","parentUuid":"e4ca2d31-137a-46d3-96cd-3e9e8c5e9a76","uuid":"e19d329a-9208-43b2-8f28-285ba7edf452"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["fd4637a2-a117-460a-a7fa-c03760c42629"]},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2020-11-11T10:53:42Z","entityUuid":"f87c331d-794a-42c8-a910-61a2a9110dab","parentUuid":"b1df3c74-0b1f-4574-81c4-4cc2d780c1af","uuid":"6f5f425f-3eda-428f-a8a5-177ccd84e65e"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"itemTemplateQuestionUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ListQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Have you identified types of data that you will use that are used by others too? Some types of data (for example \"images\" or \"tables\") are used by many different projects. For such data, often common standards exist (in our example \"JPG\" and \"CSV\" [comma separated values]) that help to make these data reusable. Are you using such common data formats?\n\nPlease make sure you list all the data types that are important for your project. You should make sure also to list the formats used in any data sets that you are re-using."},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2020-11-11T10:53:43Z","entityUuid":"b08fe063-33f8-4380-b3a9-ba1e586dedf2","parentUuid":"b1df3c74-0b1f-4574-81c4-4cc2d780c1af","uuid":"8542a9b5-03b5-4b74-9e10-1c2274ecfcb1"},{"content":{"allowCustomReply":true,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddIntegrationEvent","integrationType":"ApiIntegration","name":"Wikidata","requestAllowEmptySearch":true,"requestBody":"","requestHeaders":[{"key":"Accept","value":"application/json"},{"key":"User-Agent","value":"DSW-KM/dsw:root"}],"requestMethod":"GET","requestUrl":"https://query.wikidata.org/sparql?query=SELECT DISTINCT ?item ?itemLabel WHERE { ?item wdt:P31 ${type} . ?item rdfs:label ?label . ?item schema:description ?description . FILTER contains(lcase(concat(?label, ?description)), lcase('${q}')) SERVICE wikibase:label { bd:serviceParam wikibase:language \"en\". } }","responseItemTemplate":"{{item.itemLabel.value}}","responseItemTemplateForSelection":null,"responseListField":"results.bindings","testQ":"","testResponse":null,"testVariables":{},"variables":["type"]},"createdAt":"2020-11-11T10:53:44Z","entityUuid":"b2ae610d-8dd1-4c4d-bf78-5a3c9f00e5d8","parentUuid":"6f6241d9-136c-4770-9d58-8a3f39607052","uuid":"09f2a5c9-4763-4f6a-a63f-528412f3117e"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"integrationUuid":{"changed":true,"value":"b2ae610d-8dd1-4c4d-bf78-5a3c9f00e5d8"},"questionType":"IntegrationQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false},"variables":{"changed":true,"value":{"type":"wd:Q79719"}}},"createdAt":"2020-11-11T10:53:45Z","entityUuid":"28712f2b-1775-4c81-8d87-4bf0b95c2a64","parentUuid":"f8e70d3c-0a97-41cb-a586-1f8aadad9620","uuid":"199ca66c-78b9-401c-b0c7-15176fc1dc7f"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":false},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Domain repositories often have the best functionality to make the data findable and reusable: even though it may look like a database that could be reused in a completely different field would be better findable in a generic repository, the limited availability of domain-specific metadata make that less valuable.\n\nMany repositories are listed in https://fairsharing.org/\n\nIf a repository offers to give your data set a DOI or alternative persistent identifier it is a good idea to use that option."},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2020-11-11T10:53:46Z","entityUuid":"80a682bd-8a5c-4a52-935d-680509838a4e","parentUuid":"81d3095e-a530-40a4-878e-ced42fabc4cd","uuid":"c7bd96af-7183-47c6-a5fb-a6abb99b29bd"},{"content":{"advice":null,"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddAnswerEvent","label":"Yes, Trained support staff is available","metricMeasures":[]},"createdAt":"2020-11-11T10:53:47Z","entityUuid":"8993a53e-f7e0-4a16-a240-b8e0835e86b2","parentUuid":"83c0d09d-e74c-4c81-a52c-aaa2e18415ac","uuid":"3a700f6e-bae8-42e1-ba8f-1f