e":"Will the repository make sure the persistent identifier can be resolved to a digital object?"},"createdAt":"2022-01-14T16:08:57Z","entityUuid":"7f55274c-a5f5-4f6a-94d8-531ea0077462","parentUuid":"1072923b-8330-4da1-9b5f-9880afa053a9","uuid":"1795fe7c-9185-4b28-8a2b-7d45829d9805"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["87bb2042-8e3c-4733-ba1e-84509d7b1cf4"]},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2022-01-14T16:08:58Z","entityUuid":"c928d464-4ae7-447c-82f6-bc525d2596a9","parentUuid":"1072923b-8330-4da1-9b5f-9880afa053a9","uuid":"520fdfae-7ea2-4f5d-a1f8-4bb3c168082e"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"ValueQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":null,"tagUuids":[],"text":null,"title":"Specify the assigned persistent identifier","validations":[],"valueType":"StringQuestionValueType"},"createdAt":"2022-01-14T16:08:59Z","entityUuid":"22e898b5-87c2-4c29-89b3-fd08bce01a23","parentUuid":"1072923b-8330-4da1-9b5f-9880afa053a9","uuid":"3399c65b-66b8-4e10-9b13-4c312176da77"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["87bb2042-8e3c-4733-ba1e-84509d7b1cf4"]},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":true,"value":"Who assigns the persistent identifier?"}},"createdAt":"2022-01-14T16:09:00Z","entityUuid":"c928d464-4ae7-447c-82f6-bc525d2596a9","parentUuid":"1072923b-8330-4da1-9b5f-9880afa053a9","uuid":"0eeef5ac-1a24-4653-97c4-098dc092c316"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"answerUuids":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"OptionsQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["87bb2042-8e3c-4733-ba1e-84509d7b1cf4"]},"text":{"changed":true,"value":"Datasets can be assigned persistent identifiers. Just like journal articles get assigned DOIs, these are often also used for data sets. Note that the DOI of a paper is not a persistent identifier for its supplementary information."},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2022-01-14T16:09:01Z","entityUuid":"d21fdb06-22bf-418e-aa40-dc5ef1485f56","parentUuid":"81d3095e-a530-40a4-878e-ced42fabc4cd","uuid":"3fcb483e-1aea-45c6-a010-54b92c3f9fb4"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"ValueQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":["87bb2042-8e3c-4733-ba1e-84509d7b1cf4"],"text":"Specify an amount including the relevant","title":"How much have you budgeted for making data or other research outputs FAIR?","validations":[],"valueType":"StringQuestionValueType"},"createdAt":"2022-01-14T16:09:02Z","entityUuid":"2a0cf686-63ed-44b6-ae74-38ddd39ac741","parentUuid":"db44d6ca-efc2-413e-8abc-d92f92ed1d1d","uuid":"ac47324b-6123-4f76-a610-fc616296aebc"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"ListQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":["87bb2042-8e3c-4733-ba1e-84509d7b1cf4"],"text":null,"title":"Describe the national / funder / sectorial / departmental policies and procedures for data management that you will be using."},"createdAt":"2022-01-14T16:09:03Z","entityUuid":"87964502-4401-45e5-9084-d6c84a417acf","parentUuid":"1e85da40-bbfc-4180-903e-6c569ed2da38","uuid":"923bbdc9-5911-4fd7-9f19-196fc6651106"},{"content":{"annotations":[],"eventType":"AddQuestionEvent","questionType":"OptionsQuestion","requiredPhaseUuid":"1796fa3c-9f53-475f-89ff-c66a0453c42e","tagUuids":["87bb2042-8e3c-4733-ba1e-845