"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["87bb2042-8e3c-4733-ba1e-84509d7b1cf4","19b0fe70-a884-4539-96b9-a0aaf8c9b884","fd4637a2-a117-460a-a7fa-c03760c42629"]},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2024-07-01T12:20:57Z","entityUuid":"2964c7f7-d9be-42ac-8cfe-dbcf4d62f8a2","parentUuid":"2e37f71b-b7aa-4182-888a-8b7a5156b53c","uuid":"d83b08b6-54d9-44d4-9940-d9d2e944fd96"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"itemTemplateQuestionUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ListQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["3c7bdc90-8ed3-4b34-90ec-7945d14cc443","87bb2042-8e3c-4733-ba1e-84509d7b1cf4","19b0fe70-a884-4539-96b9-a0aaf8c9b884","fd4637a2-a117-460a-a7fa-c03760c42629"]},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2024-07-01T12:21:01Z","entityUuid":"353eeaca-45fa-4958-a33c-ec6de3075701","parentUuid":"c3dabaaf-c946-4a0d-889c-ede966f97667","uuid":"735587ca-7083-49af-b3c2-f18a08aed1aa"},{"content":{"annotations":{"changed":false},"eventType":"EditQuestionEvent","expertUuids":{"changed":false},"questionType":"ValueQuestion","referenceUuids":{"changed":false},"requiredPhaseUuid":{"changed":false},"tagUuids":{"changed":true,"value":["3c7bdc90-8ed3-4b34-90ec-7945d14cc443","87bb2042-8e3c-4733-ba1e-84509d7b1cf4","19b0fe70-a884-4539-96b9-a0aaf8c9b884","fd4637a2-a117-460a-a7fa-c03760c42629"]},"text":{"changed":false},"title":{"changed":false},"validations":{"changed":false},"valueType":{"changed":false}},"createdAt":"2024-07-01T12:21:07Z","entityUuid":"b3d9b6ca-bd24-4fa3-a3bd-d15005b9ae8b","parentUuid":"353eeaca-45fa-4958-a